@startuml
actor user as usr
participant shipList as sl
participant ship as ship
participant travel as travel
autonumber
usr -> sl : requests ships with mostkilometers travelled and average speed
sl --> usr : requests how many ships must be listed
usr -> sl: types how many ships will be listed
sl -> ship : requests distance done by each ship
ship -> travel: requests distance of each ship's travel and duration
travel --> ship: sends requested data
ship --> sl : send sum of ship total travel distance and average speed
sl -->sl : creates list with n elements ordered by traveled distance
sl --> usr : shows the list requested
@enduml